<title>CROATIA: Croatian Nov 96 crude output fell, natural gas ros.</title>
<headline>Croatian Nov 96 crude output fell, natural gas ros.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following crude and natural gas output details.</p>
<p> CROATIA OIL EXTRACTION	NOV '96    OCT '96     NOV '95</p>
<p> Crude petroleum (tonnes)    128,700    142,173     134,264</p>
<p> Natural gas (000 cu m)	155,316    150,361     122,261</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCTS (tonnes)</p>
<p> Gasoline			  121,492     76,142     122,261</p>
<p> Gas oil			    94,541     60,851	90,943</p>
<p> Heating oil		     212,864    136,000     207,487</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exlude production from oilfields in Serb-held Eastern Slavonia region which was partly restarted last August. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
